'''Brine ground''' is a beneficial and detrimental [[ground effect]]. Enemies on Brine Ground have 30% increased effect of Lightning and Cold [[Ailment]]s on them and 25% reduced [[Armour]] and [[Evasion]] rating. Allies on Brine Ground gain 10% of Physical Damage as each of extra Cold and Lightning Damage

==Sources==
Brine ground is exclusive to the [[Velka Bloodline]]'s [[Tide Caller]] ascendancy passive skill.

